# Tamsin O'Rook

## Identity
- **Full Name:** Tamsin O'Rook
- **Age:** 23
- **Gender:** Female
- **Occupation / Role:** Clerk, harbor-master's office

## Appearance
Small and quick, copper hair cut short, ink on both cuffs.

## Personality
Eager to be useful and slow to ask why. Loyal to whoever gave her the post.

## Background
Hired by Hesk Varrow the winter the tallow casks went missing.

## Relationships
| Person | Relationship | Notes |
|--------|-------------|-------|
| [[Hesk Varrow]] | Employer | Does what the wording of an errand implies |

## Current Status
- **Location:** Harrowmere, harbor-master's office
- **Physical condition:** Healthy
- **Story state:** Alive
- **Last updated in:** Salt and Signal — Chapter 4

## Notes
Sent to the Tally House to retrieve a document she was not told the contents of.

