|-----------------|-------------|-------|
| [[Tidewright Union]] | Rival | Competes for the tallow trade |
| [[Fen Wardens]] | Neutral | Escorts the Guild's convoys |

## Current Status
- **Standing:** Nominally dominant on the quays
- **Internal condition:** Openly divided; the vote has been postponed
- **Last updated in:** Salt and Signal — Chapter 4

## Notes
None at this time.

